The change left: tokens names every hit above the z cut (351 in the measured search, seon.doc/named-hits 2.0M) when a search shows k and fuses the first k x related-near: name the hits the fusion can reach (a text hit past rank r scores at most 1/(c+r) in the text ranking, so past the point where that and its best other ranking cannot reach the first k x related-near it is counted by kind, not named), or say why every one must be named. Measure on main's program first: what tokens costs of a search now that relevance's tokenizing is gone.

